# __NAME__

An Idrak plug-in, written with Idrak's public API only. It registers:

- the packed weight format `__FORMAT__` (`src/__NAME__/RoundedWeight.cs`): values rounded to bfloat16 precision;
  replace the packing, `Dequantize` and `MatMul` with your own;
- the network step `__FORMAT__-softplus` (`src/__NAME__/Plugin.cs`), usable from the network builder and from a
  network JSON.

```
dotnet build
dotnet run --project tests/__NAME__.Tests            # the tests on the CPU; add -- vulkan:0 for another device
idrak plugins list --plugin src/__NAME__/bin/Debug/net10.0/__NAME__.dll
idrak run MODEL "Hello" -w __FORMAT__ --plugin src/__NAME__/bin/Debug/net10.0/__NAME__.dll
```

From your own code, reference the project (or its package) and call `__NAMESPACE__.Plugin.Register()` once.
